["Your vault is now unlocked!", "", "To unlock your vault, set your session key to the `BW_SESSION` environment variable. ex:", "$ export BW_SESSION=\"MWvsZhA4U9tFUCbGzjPts0jrMKWLHe+ExYku6oxti4A+/QtYGWNmR817lS8hiDrKpcwV/Hz8VwHNVz6VnW9e7Q==\"", "> $env:BW_SESSION=\"MWvsZhA4U9tFUCbGzjPts0jrMKWLHe+ExYku6oxti4A+/QtYGWNmR817lS8hiDrKpcwV/Hz8VwHNVz6VnW9e7Q==\"", "", "You can also pass the session key to any command with the `--session` option. ex:", "$ bw list items --session MWvsZhA4U9tFUCbGzjPts0jrMKWLHe+ExYku6oxti4A+/QtYGWNmR817lS8hiDrKpcwV/Hz8VwHNVz6VnW9e7Q=="]